usage: ir2-benchmark [-h]
                     {doctor,rollout,maps,train-a,train-b,evaluate,report,throughput,validation-manifest}
                     ...

positional arguments:
  {doctor,rollout,maps,train-a,train-b,evaluate,report,throughput,validation-manifest}
    doctor              Check JAX batching and Flax/Optax training
    rollout             Run the ordered-event exploration smoke scenario
    maps                Audit IR2 sources or generate new maps
    train-a             Run route A on real exploration events
    train-b             Run route B on real exploration events
    evaluate            Run paired checkpoint scenarios in the real
                        environment
    report              Report actual results and missing matrix conditions
    throughput          Measure synchronized whole-environment throughput
    validation-manifest
                        Freeze a validation-only model-selection workload

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
